# CODEOWNERS
#
# @yasserfullstack-tech is the only maintainer on this repository, so every
# pattern below resolves to the same account. The explicit entries are not
# multi-team routing: they make ownership of sensitive areas visible during
# review, and keep the mapping correct if a second maintainer is ever added.
#
# GitHub reads only one CODEOWNERS file, using the first of these that exists:
#   CODEOWNERS  ->  .github/CODEOWNERS  ->  docs/CODEOWNERS
# This repository uses the root file; do not add a second copy.
#
# Related: docs/release-controls.md section 12 item 4. Note that
# `require_code_owner_review` is deliberately still OFF in
# .github/rulesets/main.json - turning it on changes who can merge, so it is an
# owner decision, not part of this file.

# Default owner for everything in the repository.
*                                  @yasserfullstack-tech

# Release controls: CI workflows, branch-protection rulesets, PR template.
/.github/                          @yasserfullstack-tech

# Deployment and production infrastructure.
/infra/                            @yasserfullstack-tech
/docker-compose.yml                @yasserfullstack-tech
/docker-compose.production.yml     @yasserfullstack-tech
/docker-compose.load.yml           @yasserfullstack-tech
/docker-compose.load-chaos.yml     @yasserfullstack-tech

# Database schema and migrations.
/packages/db/                      @yasserfullstack-tech

# Money, identity, secrets and object storage.
/packages/billing/                 @yasserfullstack-tech
/packages/credentials/             @yasserfullstack-tech
/packages/auth/                    @yasserfullstack-tech
/packages/storage/                 @yasserfullstack-tech

# Environment templates - they do not contain secrets, but they define which
# secrets exist, so changes here are reviewed too.
/.env.example                      @yasserfullstack-tech
/.env.production.example           @yasserfullstack-tech
/.env.staging.example              @yasserfullstack-tech

# Legal, compliance and release-control documentation.
/docs/legal/                       @yasserfullstack-tech
/docs/release-controls.md          @yasserfullstack-tech
/docs/production-readiness-plan.md @yasserfullstack-tech
